# ONE HACKER. 178 ORGANISATIONS. ONE TRUSTED SOFTWARE!

Sherubai oru website build pannirundhaan. Security-ku oru third-party tool install pannaan. Adha paathu Manga Manjula, "Dei, veettu security-ku thirudanaiye watchman-ah vachitiya?" nu kalaicha!

Aana andha joke nijamaagiduchu!

November sixteenth, Optimizely-nu oru trusted website tool-la vulnerability exploit panni, hackers malicious JavaScript inject pannanga.

Indha tool-a Zoom, BBC, CNN, HSBC maadhiri organisations use pannitu irundhaanga.

Hackers ovvoru company website-ah hack pannala. Ore trusted tool vazhiya avanga visitors browser-kulla enter aayittaanga!

Researcher Scott Helme, one thousand six hundred eleven snippets check pannumbodhu, one hundred and eighty-eight infected snippets, one hundred and seventy-eight organisations-la irundhadha discover pannaaru!

Andha malicious code card details, cookies, crypto wallet information steal panna try pannuchu!

Idha dhaan Supply Chain Attack nu solvom.

Sherubai-ku appo dhaan purinjadhu... Veettu kathava lock panninaa mattum podhaadhu, veettukku porul kondu vara delivery boy-aiyum check pannanum!

So, third-party scripts audit pannunga, security policies implement pannunga, dependencies monitor pannunga.

Neenga trust panra software kooda compromise aagalaam!

Cybersecurity breakdowns ku The Bot Academy follow pannitu sherubai nu comment pannuga!








# GOOGLE'S ELEPHANT–GOLDFISH MODEL

Sherubai oru software project build panna poraan. Manga Manjula-kitta plan review panna sonnaan.

Aval enna sonna theriyuma? "Nee ezhudhina plan-ah neeye review panriya? Unakku un mistake theriyuma, illa unakku neeye fan club-ah?"

Adhaan AI development-layum oru problem!

Ore AI project context-la discuss pannum, plan write pannum, adhe plan-ah review pannum. Fresh perspective miss aagalaam!

Idhukku Google-oda open-source Elephant–Goldfish plugin oru interesting approach use pannudhu!

Elephant project context full-ah understand panni design document prepare pannum.

Appuram Goldfish reviewers-ku andha document mattum kuduppaanga. Previous conversation history kudukka maattaanga!

Avanga fresh-ah padichu, missing requirements, confusing logic, hidden risks ellam kandupidippaanga.

Oru Goldfish-ku plan explain panna mudiyalana, document-e clear illa-nu artham!

Multiple reviewers different angles-la attack pannuvaanga. Findings Elephant-kitta thirumbi pogum. Developer fix pannitu approve pannuvaaru.

Basically, Elephant plan podum, Goldfish plan-ah kelvi kekkum!

Aana idhu bug-free code guarantee illa. Human review-um testing-um mukkiyam!

Coding start panradhukku munnadi plan-ah correct pannunga. Illana bug-ku birthday celebration neengadhaan arrange pannanum!

idhoda document file venumna The Bot Academy follow pannitu,Elephant nu comment pannuga!
